      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0015:0001",
      "blockId": "code:discussion:0015",
      "type": "preserve",
      "source": "```swift\nfunc convolution3X3(inputImage: CIImage) -> CIImage? {\n    let convolutionFilter = CIFilter.convolution3X3()\n    convolutionFilter.inputImage = inputImage\n    let kernel = CIVector(values: [\n        0, -2, 0,\n        -2, 9, -2,\n        0, -2, 0\n    ], count: 9)\n    convolutionFilter.weights = kernel\n    convolutionFilter.bias = 0.0\n    return convolutionFilter.outputImage!\n}\n```",
      "normalizedSource": "```swift func convolution3X3(inputImage: CIImage) -> CIImage? { let convolutionFilter = CIFilter.convolution3X3() convolutionFilter.inputImage = inputImage let kernel = CIVector(values: [ 0, -2, 0, -2, 9, -2, 0, -2, 0 ], count: 9) convolutionFilter.weights = kernel convolutionFilter.bias = 0.0 return convolutionFilter.outputImage! } ```",
      "sourceHash": "c4215e4a147b8844ce0a4f42dbaa39fed6ff7650f65b8e441ecf53e62013f237",
      "translatable": false,
